*Sahih al-Bukhari 7026, Book 91 Interpretation of Dreams
*Sahih al-Bukhari 7128, Book 92 Afflictions and the End of the World
*{آدَمُ is used for the Messiah same as the other 3 hadith above which is not a (حْمَرُ) red colour like the dajjal, sunnah.com has not used an appropriate translation}

Imam Muslim:

1st Messiah:
